WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:06.295
"It's time for our final contest!" the Battle Master said as the crowd cheered.

2
00:00:06.296 --> 00:00:15.104
"It will be a four-way battle between Kid Comet, Rocket Girl, Sun Wukong, and the dragon!"

3
00:00:15.105 --> 00:00:18.522
Soon all four contestants stood in the arena.

4
00:00:18.523 --> 00:00:24.019
Wukong scratched his head. "What do we do now? I won't fight you guys."

5
00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:27.621
Sapphire snorted. "I won't either.

6
00:00:27.622 --> 00:00:30.678
I don't approve of this competition anyway."

7
00:00:30.679 --> 00:00:34.035
Roxy bit her lip. "I don't know . . ."

8
00:00:34.036 --> 00:00:36.940
She looked at Cozlin, who still seemed upset.

9
00:00:36.941 --> 00:00:38.451
Audience members shouted.

10
00:00:38.452 --> 00:00:40.502
"This is boring!"

11
00:00:40.503 --> 00:00:43.245
"I paid to see a real fight!"

12
00:00:43.246 --> 00:00:48.519
Wukong pulled out his iron bar. "Let's just pretend to fight."

13
00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:51.321
Roxy nodded and then shot her eye laser beams.

14
00:00:51.322 --> 00:00:54.318
Wukong pretended to be scared and jumped out of the way.

15
00:00:54.319 --> 00:00:57.093
Sapphire shot flames into the sky.

16
00:00:57.094 --> 00:00:59.881
Then Roxy saw Cozlin zip toward her.

17
00:00:59.882 --> 00:01:01.676
Was her friend going to attack?

18
00:01:01.677 --> 00:01:04.913
Roxy held up her fists, ready to defend herself.

19
00:01:04.914 --> 00:01:07.549
Cozlin gave her a funny look.

20
00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:11.229
"You don't really think I'm going to fight you, do you?"

21
00:01:11.230 --> 00:01:15.663
Roxy smiled. "I thought you were upset with me."

22
00:01:15.664 --> 00:01:21.031
Cozlin shrugged. "I was hurt, Roxy, but we're still friends."

23
00:01:21.032 --> 00:01:26.488
"This fight stinks!" someone yelled. The crowd began to boo.

24
00:01:26.489 --> 00:01:29.337
A fighter pounded on the wall of his cube.

25
00:01:29.338 --> 00:01:31.907
"Let me out! I'll fight those wimps!"

26
00:01:31.908 --> 00:01:37.972
"Yeah!" another fighter yelled. "I want that golden asteroid!"

27
00:01:37.973 --> 00:01:44.639
Roxy's watch beeped. "Terrell! What's going on? Is Metro City okay?"

28
00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:49.856
"We stopped the earthquakes, and the bodhisattva returned the gold," Terrell said.

29
00:01:49.857 --> 00:01:53.203
"Dr. Odd and I are here to help you escape!"

30
00:01:53.204 --> 00:01:56.659
"What?" Roxy cried. "You're here?"

31
00:01:56.660 --> 00:02:01.253
"Yes," Dr. Odd said. "But we can't get in.

32
00:02:01.254 --> 00:02:04.489
The stadium's surrounded by a force field.

33
00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:09.573
I hacked into the computer system, but there are hundreds of force fields.

34
00:02:09.574 --> 00:02:12.485
I don't know which one to turn off."

35
00:02:12.486 --> 00:02:15.723
Roxy looked at the other fighters in their cubes.

36
00:02:15.724 --> 00:02:20.779
"Hmm," she thought. "Every cube must be a force field."

37
00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:25.387
Suddenly several cubes vanished, and the fighters dropped to the ground.

38
00:02:25.388 --> 00:02:29.219
"I just disabled more force fields," Dr. Odd said.

39
00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:33.928
"But the stadium is still surrounded. I'll keep working on it."

40
00:02:33.929 --> 00:02:38.684
"Start fighting!" the Battle Master shouted.

41
00:02:38.685 --> 00:02:42.384
"We won't fight each other!" Cozlin yelled.

42
00:02:42.385 --> 00:02:47.827
"Yeah!" Wukong glared at the Battle Master. "I'll fight you though!"

43
00:02:47.828 --> 00:02:50.541
The Battle Master shouted at Wukong.

44
00:02:50.542 --> 00:02:53.437
As he did, more and more cubes vanished.

45
00:02:53.438 --> 00:02:56.695
There was now a big group of fighters on the stadium floor.

46
00:02:56.696 --> 00:03:00.173
A slug with wings stood tall. "I'll fight!"

47
00:03:00.174 --> 00:03:03.972
A frog flexed its muscles. "Me too!"

48
00:03:03.973 --> 00:03:07.819
The Battle Master looked startled. "How did you . . . ?"

49
00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:11.382
More fighters jumped to the ground as their cubes vanished.

50
00:03:11.383 --> 00:03:13.727
The Battle Master looked around frantically.

51
00:03:13.728 --> 00:03:17.967
"What's going on? What happened to your cubes?"

52
00:03:17.968 --> 00:03:23.725
"Who cares?" a blob said. "I just want that golden asteroid!"

53
00:03:23.726 --> 00:03:29.788
"No way!" Glytar said. "It's mine!"

54
00:03:29.789 --> 00:03:33.621
"That's what you think!" A green monster knocked him over.

55
00:03:33.622 --> 00:03:36.276
Soon there was a big brawl.

56
00:03:36.277 --> 00:03:42.343
"A . . . a change of plans!" the Battle Master said, his voice shaking.

57
00:03:42.344 --> 00:03:47.376
He pressed a button on his palm, and every cube vanished.

58
00:03:47.377 --> 00:03:53.524
"We'll have a huge battle—the biggest battle anyone has ever seen!

59
00:03:53.525 --> 00:03:58.313
And there can be only one winner!"

60
00:03:58.314 --> 00:04:02.930
Roxy gulped.

